  "description": "This can’t be happening. There has never been a Great White in these waters before. Never. This is more than a coincidence. This shark is different. Relentless. As if it’s hunting you down… like it’s personal.\n\nYou’d better prepare yourself and strike back before it’s too late. Will you use the mini-sub, seaplane, sailboat, or scuba gear? Maybe it won’t even matter. Remember, you’re dealing with an unbelievably powerful eating machine.\n\nQuick, grab your weapons, pack your explosives, and check your maps. It’s out there. You know it. And it’s coming for you. This is serious. Including two different game modes, JAWS Retro Edition and JAWS Enhanced Edition, this is the ultimate JAWS challenge!\n\nJAWS: Retro Edition Features\n• Save anywhere\n• Rewind\n• Achievements/Trophies\n• Music Player\n• Gallery\n\nJAWS: Enhanced Edition Features\n• A massively expanded, multi-chapter adventure with nods and homages to all four JAWS films\n• New quests and objectives\n• New abilities and weapons for both boat and diver\n• More challenging enemies, and more ways to take them down\n• A deeper realization of the original NES game’s role-playing roots",
